      </p>
      <div class="reveal mt-9">
        <a href="/scenario-map/"
          class="inline-block rounded-full bg-yes-deep px-8 py-4 font-medium text-white shadow-[0_12px_32px_-8px_var(--color-yes)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Get your scenario map →
