        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-faint">
          Rather talk to a person? <a href="https://t.me/yesmcp_bot?start=for_professional_services" class="link-und text-yes-deep">Message us on Telegram</a> or write to <a href="mailto:yes@yesmcp.com?subject=A connector for our practice" class="link-und">yes@yesmcp.com</a>
        </p>
